[32m+[m[32m## How it works[m
 [m
[31m-This is not a mixer, not a bank, and not a business.[m
[32m+[m[32m- One paid drink per Lightning address per UTC day.[m
[32m+[m[32m- A shared connection (building Wi-Fi) can drink twice a UTC day.[m
[32m+[m[32m- A random pour. Ordinary sips grow with the size of the pot. The jackpot is 10% of the pot and gets rarer as the prize grows. One jackpot per UTC day.[m
[32m+[m[32m- A UTC day pays about 30% of the pot in ordinary pours, then the spring rests. Under 1,000 sats the cap is off.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Streaks: paid days in a row lift the sip (+1% per day, up to +25%) and the jackpot odds (up to 1.5×). Seven days earns one grace day. Days the pot is dry do not break a streak.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Anyone can fill the spring with a Lightning invoice (100–10,000 sats, one address per 24 hours).[m
[32m+[m[32m- Spam is blocked with a small proof-of-work puzzle in the browser, plus per-address and per-connection limits.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Visitors from sanctioned countries are refused (see `src/lib/geo-block.ts`).[m
[32m+[m[32m- English and Spanish. A live badge for other sites: iframe `/embed`, or `GET /api/pot` (CORS open).[m
